Package: uwbranding
Title: UW-Madison Brand Identity for R and Quarto
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Chris", "Muir", email = "cdmuir@wisc.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides ggplot2 themes, color palettes, and Quarto document
    templates conforming to the University of Wisconsin-Madison brand identity.
    Includes light and dark variants for PDF documents, RevealJS presentations,
    and Beamer slides. Quarto template files are copied into user projects via
    use_uw_pdf(), use_uw_revealjs(), and use_uw_beamer().
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
