RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Imports:
    ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0)
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
